6.2. Add Expense Screen# The screen would be something like this:
We have:
Two TextFields One Button to choose the type of expense One Button (use the Camera icon as the background) to pick the image for receipt. FInally, the Add Expense Button. AddExpenseView# Let&rsquo;s open the AddExpenseView.swift file and update the code. Remove the PickerView and add two buttons (to select expense type and pick receipt image).
