Now let&rsquo;s handle the actions for buttonTakePhoto (with the camera icon). If the user taps the button, it should display two options: &ldquo;Camera&rdquo; and &ldquo;Gallery.&rdquo; If the user selects the &ldquo;Camera&rdquo; option, it will open the camera and take a photo; else, if the user selects &ldquo;Gallery,&rdquo; it will open the image gallery to pick a photo. Finally, the chosen photo will be set as the image inside buttonTakePhoto.
